  {
   "type": "title",
   "text": "Material & CO2 Estimation for 1,082 Buildings - Method 1 (BAG x B2 material profile)"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "23 September 2026"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "1. Summary"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "This document explains how Method 1 calculates material mass and CO2 for 1,082 buildings: 1,081 demolition buildings plus one added building, Jan Provostlaan 16 in Bilthoven. Method 1 needs one measured number per building - the gross floor area (GO) from BAG - and multiplies it by the material intensities of Tabel B2 for the building's type and age. The result is 4,335,383 tonnes of material and 1,874,724 tonnes CO2e, reported in 13 materials."
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Material",
    "Mass (tonnes)",
    "CO2e (tonnes)",
    "Buildings with 0"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
