  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Every number is one of three kinds:"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "MEASURED - read directly from a BAG field (gross floor area, building type, year built)."
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "DERIVED - calculated only from measured numbers (mass = area x intensity, CO2 = mass x factor)."
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "ASSUMED - our own chosen value: the B2 profile per building type and age, and the emission factors."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Method 1 uses no geometry: two buildings with the same floor area, type and age get the same material estimate, whatever their shape. Method 2 is the geometry-based estimate and is described in its own document; section 15 compares the two."
  },
