  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "2.2 Why 1,082 buildings"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The demolition dataset holds 1,187 notices; counting unique pand_id gives 1,081 buildings, so each building is counted once. Jan Provostlaan 16 (pand_id 0310100000664117) has no demolition notice and was added by hand, which makes 1,082. Its row has no notice_id but does have a pand_id, and it is the same building the Method 2 document uses as its added building."
  },
